{"seq":1,"slug":"micro-frontend-concepts","title":"微前端概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/micro-frontends/micro-frontend-concepts","wordCount":837,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"微前端概念\">微前端概念</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微前端（Micro Frontends）是一种架构模式，将一个大型前端应用拆分为多个较小的、可独立开发和部署的前端应用。每个微前端拥有自己的代码库、技术栈选择、构建流程和部署周期。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 单体前端&#10;        MONO[一个巨大的前端应用&lt;br/&gt;一个团队 · 一个仓库 · 一次部署]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 微前端&#10;        SHELL[Shell / 容器应用]&#10;        SHELL --&gt; MF1[微前端 A&lt;br/&gt;团队 A · 独立部署]&#10;        SHELL --&gt; MF2[微前端 B&lt;br/&gt;团队 B · 独立部署]&#10;        SHELL --&gt; MF3[微前端 C&lt;br/&gt;团队 C · 独立部署]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 单体前端\n        MONO[一个巨大的前端应用&lt;br/&gt;一个团队 · 一个仓库 · 一次部署]\n    end\n    subgraph 微前端\n        SHELL[Shell / 容器应用]\n        SHELL --&gt; MF1[微前端 A&lt;br/&gt;团队 A · 独立部署]\n        SHELL --&gt; MF2[微前端 B&lt;br/&gt;团队 B · 独立部署]\n        SHELL --&gt; MF3[微前端 C&lt;br/&gt;团队 C · 独立部署]\n    end</pre><p>微前端的核心价值在于<strong>团队自治</strong>——每个团队可以独立选择技术栈、独立开发迭代、独立测试部署，不受其他团队的阻塞。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"微前端要解决的问题\">微前端要解决的问题</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    PROBLEM[单体前端痛点]&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; P1[团队间耦合&lt;br/&gt;一个团队的变更&lt;br/&gt;阻塞其他团队]&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; P2[构建缓慢&lt;br/&gt;代码量增长&lt;br/&gt;构建时间线性增加]&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; P3[发布风险&lt;br/&gt;全量发布&lt;br/&gt;一个 Bug 影响全站]&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; P4[技术债务&lt;br/&gt;难以增量升级&lt;br/&gt;技术栈锁定]\">graph LR\n    PROBLEM[单体前端痛点]\n    PROBLEM --&gt; P1[团队间耦合&lt;br/&gt;一个团队的变更&lt;br/&gt;阻塞其他团队]\n    PROBLEM --&gt; P2[构建缓慢&lt;br/&gt;代码量增长&lt;br/&gt;构建时间线性增加]\n    PROBLEM --&gt; P3[发布风险&lt;br/&gt;全量发布&lt;br/&gt;一个 Bug 影响全站]\n    PROBLEM --&gt; P4[技术债务&lt;br/&gt;难以增量升级&lt;br/&gt;技术栈锁定]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>单体前端</th>\n<th>微前端</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>团队协作</td>\n<td>所有团队在同一代码库中工作</td>\n<td>每个团队独立代码库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署频率</td>\n<td>全量部署，频率受限</td>\n<td>独立部署，各自节奏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术栈升级</td>\n<td>一次性全量升级，风险高</td>\n<td>渐进式升级，按模块迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障隔离</td>\n<td>一个模块崩溃可能影响整个应用</td>\n<td>模块间隔离，故障范围受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建速度</td>\n<td>随代码量增长持续恶化</td>\n<td>每个微前端独立构建，耗时可控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"适用场景\">适用场景</h2><p>微前端并不适合所有项目。引入微前端架构会增加显著的工程复杂度，只有当收益超过成本时才值得采用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"适合微前端的场景\">适合微前端的场景</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q1{多个独立团队&lt;br/&gt;开发同一个应用？}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|是| Q2{各团队需要&lt;br/&gt;独立部署？}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|是| Q3{应用足够大&lt;br/&gt;模块间边界清晰？}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|是| YES[✅ 适合微前端]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|否| NO[❌ 不需要微前端]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|否| NO&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|否| MONO[考虑 Monorepo&lt;br/&gt;模块化方案]\">flowchart TD\n    Q1{多个独立团队&lt;br/&gt;开发同一个应用？}\n    Q1 --&gt;|是| Q2{各团队需要&lt;br/&gt;独立部署？}\n    Q2 --&gt;|是| Q3{应用足够大&lt;br/&gt;模块间边界清晰？}\n    Q3 --&gt;|是| YES[✅ 适合微前端]\n    Q1 --&gt;|否| NO[❌ 不需要微前端]\n    Q2 --&gt;|否| NO\n    Q3 --&gt;|否| MONO[考虑 Monorepo&lt;br/&gt;模块化方案]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>大型企业应用</strong>：多个业务团队各自负责不同的功能模块</li>\n<li><strong>渐进式迁移</strong>：从旧技术栈（如 jQuery/Angular.js）逐步迁移到新技术栈</li>\n<li><strong>收购/合并</strong>：需要将不同公司的前端产品整合到统一入口</li>\n<li><strong>平台型产品</strong>：核心平台 + 可插拔的功能模块</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"不适合微前端的场景\">不适合微前端的场景</h3><ul>\n<li>小型团队（&lt; 5 人）开发的应用</li>\n<li>单一技术栈、紧密耦合的业务逻辑</li>\n<li>追求极致性能的 C 端产品</li>\n<li>没有独立部署需求的项目</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"微前端的核心挑战\">微前端的核心挑战</h2><h3 id=\"样式隔离\">样式隔离</h3><p>不同微前端的 CSS 可能产生冲突。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    MF_A[&quot;微前端 A&lt;br/&gt;.btn { color: red }&quot;] --&gt; CONFLICT[样式冲突]&#10;    MF_B[&quot;微前端 B&lt;br/&gt;.btn { color: blue }&quot;] --&gt; CONFLICT\">graph LR\n    MF_A[\"微前端 A&lt;br/&gt;.btn { color: red }\"] --&gt; CONFLICT[样式冲突]\n    MF_B[\"微前端 B&lt;br/&gt;.btn { color: blue }\"] --&gt; CONFLICT</pre><p>解决方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CSS Modules / CSS-in-JS（作用域隔离）</li>\n<li>Shadow DOM（完全隔离）</li>\n<li>BEM 命名 + 前缀约定</li>\n<li>Tailwind CSS（原子化，无冲突风险）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"状态共享\">状态共享</h3><p>微前端之间需要有限度的数据共享，但不能产生紧耦合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 发布-订阅模式&#10;interface MicroFrontendEvent {&#10;  type: string;&#10;  payload: unknown;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class EventBus {&#10;  private listeners = new Map&lt;string, Set&lt;(event: MicroFrontendEvent) =&gt; void&gt;&gt;();&#10;&#10;  emit(event: MicroFrontendEvent) {&#10;    this.listeners.get(event.type)?.forEach((listener) =&gt; listener(event));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  on(type: string, listener: (event: MicroFrontendEvent) =&gt; void) {&#10;    if (!this.listeners.has(type)) {&#10;      this.listeners.set(type, new Set());&#10;    }&#10;    this.listeners.get(type)!.add(listener);&#10;    return () =&gt; this.listeners.get(type)?.delete(listener);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;const eventBus = new EventBus();&#10;&#10;// 微前端 A：发送事件&#10;eventBus.emit({ type: &#39;USER_LOGIN&#39;, payload: { userId: &#39;123&#39; } });&#10;&#10;// 微前端 B：监听事件&#10;eventBus.on(&#39;USER_LOGIN&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;用户已登录:&#39;, event.payload);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 发布-订阅模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MicroFrontendEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventBus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> listeners</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MicroFrontendEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  emit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MicroFrontendEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.listeners.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.type)?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">listener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> listener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listener</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MicroFrontendEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.listeners.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(type)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.listeners.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(type, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.listeners.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(type)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(listener);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.listeners.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(type)?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(listener);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> eventBus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventBus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 微前端 A：发送事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">eventBus.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">emit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USER_LOGIN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, payload: { userId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 微前端 B：监听事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">eventBus.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USER_LOGIN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'用户已登录:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event.payload);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"路由协调\">路由协调</h3><p>多个微前端需要共享浏览器的路由状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Shell 应用的路由配置&#10;const routes = [&#10;  { path: &#39;/dashboard/*&#39;, remoteEntry: &#39;dashboard@https://cdn.example.com/dashboard/remoteEntry.js&#39; },&#10;  { path: &#39;/settings/*&#39;, remoteEntry: &#39;settings@https://cdn.example.com/settings/remoteEntry.js&#39; },&#10;  { path: &#39;/reports/*&#39;, remoteEntry: &#39;reports@https://cdn.example.com/reports/remoteEntry.js&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Shell 应用的路由配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> routes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/dashboard/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, remoteEntry: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dashboard@https://cdn.example.com/dashboard/remoteEntry.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/settings/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, remoteEntry: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'settings@https://cdn.example.com/settings/remoteEntry.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/reports/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, remoteEntry: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reports@https://cdn.example.com/reports/remoteEntry.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"共享依赖\">共享依赖</h3><p>React、ReactDOM 等基础库不应被每个微前端重复加载。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 不共享依赖&#10;        MFA_R[&quot;MF-A: React 18.3&lt;br/&gt;200KB&quot;]&#10;        MFB_R[&quot;MF-B: React 18.3&lt;br/&gt;200KB&quot;]&#10;        MFC_R[&quot;MF-C: React 18.3&lt;br/&gt;200KB&quot;]&#10;        TOTAL1[&quot;总计: 600KB React&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 共享依赖&#10;        SHARED_R[&quot;共享: React 18.3&lt;br/&gt;200KB&quot;]&#10;        MFA2[&quot;MF-A&quot;]&#10;        MFB2[&quot;MF-B&quot;]&#10;        MFC2[&quot;MF-C&quot;]&#10;        SHARED_R --&gt; MFA2&#10;        SHARED_R --&gt; MFB2&#10;        SHARED_R --&gt; MFC2&#10;        TOTAL2[&quot;总计: 200KB React&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 不共享依赖\n        MFA_R[\"MF-A: React 18.3&lt;br/&gt;200KB\"]\n        MFB_R[\"MF-B: React 18.3&lt;br/&gt;200KB\"]\n        MFC_R[\"MF-C: React 18.3&lt;br/&gt;200KB\"]\n        TOTAL1[\"总计: 600KB React\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 共享依赖\n        SHARED_R[\"共享: React 18.3&lt;br/&gt;200KB\"]\n        MFA2[\"MF-A\"]\n        MFB2[\"MF-B\"]\n        MFC2[\"MF-C\"]\n        SHARED_R --&gt; MFA2\n        SHARED_R --&gt; MFB2\n        SHARED_R --&gt; MFC2\n        TOTAL2[\"总计: 200KB React\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"微前端架构决策框架\">微前端架构决策框架</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策维度</th>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>考量因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>集成方式</td>\n<td>构建时 / 运行时 / 服务端</td>\n<td>独立部署需求、性能要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离级别</td>\n<td>完全隔离 / 半隔离 / 共享</td>\n<td>样式冲突风险、性能影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信机制</td>\n<td>事件总线 / 共享状态 / URL 参数</td>\n<td>耦合度、复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术栈</td>\n<td>统一 / 允许混用</td>\n<td>团队自治 vs 一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署模型</td>\n<td>独立域名 / 同域路径 / CDN</td>\n<td>运维复杂度、CORS 配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>微前端的核心价值是团队自治和独立部署。</li>\n<li>适合大型多团队应用、渐进式迁移和平台型产品。</li>\n<li>核心挑战包括样式隔离、状态共享、路由协调和共享依赖。</li>\n<li>微前端不是银弹——小团队/小项目应优先考虑 Monorepo 模块化方案。</li>\n<li>架构决策需要在团队自治、用户体验和工程复杂度之间找到平衡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"微前端概念","id":"微前端概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"微前端要解决的问题","id":"微前端要解决的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"适用场景","id":"适用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"适合微前端的场景","id":"适合微前端的场景"},{"level":3,"text":"不适合微前端的场景","id":"不适合微前端的场景"},{"level":2,"text":"微前端的核心挑战","id":"微前端的核心挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"样式隔离","id":"样式隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"状态共享","id":"状态共享"},{"level":3,"text":"路由协调","id":"路由协调"},{"level":3,"text":"共享依赖","id":"共享依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"微前端架构决策框架","id":"微前端架构决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自动化发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/ci-cd-and-automation/automated-releases"},"next":{"title":"Module Federation 模块联邦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/micro-frontends/module-federation"}}